                         MMDDYYYY(DATE1)
                         TIME(TIME1)
               END-EXEC.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       CHECK-ROOF-TYPE-0129.
               INSPECT WS-KEY-CHAR REPLACING ALL SPACES BY '0'.
               IF WS-STATUS-FAILED
                  PERFORM WRITE-ERROR-MESSAGE
               END-IF.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       NORMALISE-WITH-PROFITS-0130.
               EXEC CICS ASKTIME ABSTIME(ABS-TIME)
               END-EXEC.
               EXEC CICS FORMATTIME ABSTIME(ABS-TIME)
                         MMDDYYYY(DATE1)
                         TIME(TIME1)
               END-EXEC.
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*
       VALIDATE-EQUITIES-0131.
